@host = http://localhost:53438
@companyId = 3bfc578e-51bd-4a22-8926-7c368d23498a

### 업체 생성
POST {{host}}/api/companies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "해산물 월드 ",
  "address": "함경북도 상하이 브루클린3가",
  "type": "PRODUCER",
  "hubId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111"
}

### 업체 수정
PATCH {{host}}/api/companies/{{companyId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "오징오징 ",
  "address": "쓰촨성 오사카 가로수길 34가",
  "type": "PRODUCER",
  "hubId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111"
}

### 업체 목록 조회
GET {{host}}/api/companies?name=오징
Content-Type: application/json

### 업체 단건 조회
GET {{host}}/api/companies/{{companyId}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 업체 삭제
DELETE {{host}}/api/companies/{{companyId}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 상품 목록 조회 (Page 그대로 응답)
GET {{host}}/api/companies?page=0&size=999}
Accept: application/json